        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your plane by combining parts such as wings, motors, landing gear, guns, rockets and bombs. Each part has it's unique stats and can be modified by scaling it as you like. The options are limitless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/f7729392c9c47e1979e00b59067ada69.poster.avif?t=1765642512\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/f7729392c9c47e1979e00b59067ada69.webm?t=1765642512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/f7729392c9c47e1979e00b59067ada69.mp4?t=1765642512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through beautiful and comedic worlds that will test your manoeuvring skills as well as your plane design. Each level in a world can be completed in a hard or an easier way. To get the highest score you must complete the harder challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The themes of the world range from Suburbs, City, Western, Asian, Medieval and WW2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/8aac1b0d8c60b4493a5c370cb8952173.poster.avif?t=1765642512\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/8aac1b0d8c60b4493a5c370cb8952173.webm?t=1765642512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/8aac1b0d8c60b4493a5c370cb8952173.mp4?t=1765642512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get Creative - And likely fail</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/30603154b3789c5927de1b462f231088.poster.avif?t=1765642512\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/30603154b3789c5927de1b462f231088.webm?t=1765642512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/30603154b3789c5927de1b462f231088.mp4?t=1765642512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Premade Planes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If building is not for you, Aircrafter offers premade historical planes that can be used instead of building your own. Some famous examples are the legendary British Spitfire or the iconic American P-51D Mustang.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/7596e34c130d56e694349e3ea905ff12.avif?t=1765642512\" width=250 height=140 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/302f173afbdd3f0abb6365f8afec372e.avif?t=1765642512\" width=250 height=140 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly as far as you can and get on top of the leaderboard by completing missions, defeating enemies and picking up rewards and restocking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The procedural world is perfect for testing your  limits. As you progress you will gain levels that unlock new parts and crystals that unlocks perks that apply to all of your plane.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your plane by combining parts such as wings, motors, landing gear, guns, rockets and bombs. Each part has it's unique stats and can be modified by scaling it as you like. The options are limitless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/f7729392c9c47e1979e00b59067ada69.poster.avif?t=1765642512\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/f7729392c9c47e1979e00b59067ada69.webm?t=1765642512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/f7729392c9c47e1979e00b59067ada69.mp4?t=1765642512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through beautiful and comedic worlds that will test your manoeuvring skills as well as your plane design. Each level in a world can be completed in a hard or an easier way. To get the highest score you must complete the harder challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The themes of the world range from Suburbs, City, Western, Asian, Medieval and WW2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/8aac1b0d8c60b4493a5c370cb8952173.poster.avif?t=1765642512\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/8aac1b0d8c60b4493a5c370cb8952173.webm?t=1765642512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/8aac1b0d8c60b4493a5c370cb8952173.mp4?t=1765642512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get Creative - And likely fail</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/30603154b3789c5927de1b462f231088.poster.avif?t=1765642512\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/30603154b3789c5927de1b462f231088.webm?t=1765642512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/30603154b3789c5927de1b462f231088.mp4?t=1765642512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Premade Planes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If building is not for you, Aircrafter offers premade historical planes that can be used instead of building your own. Some famous examples are the legendary British Spitfire or the iconic American P-51D Mustang.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/7596e34c130d56e694349e3ea905ff12.avif?t=1765642512\" width=250 height=140 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747220/extras/302f173afbdd3f0abb6365f8afec372e.avif?t=1765642512\" width=250 height=140 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly as far as you can and get on top of the leaderboard by completing missions, defeating enemies and picking up rewards and restocking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The procedural world is perfect for testing your  limits. As you progress you will gain levels that unlock new parts and crystals that unlocks perks that apply to all of your plane.</p>",
        "short_description": "Become a master plane designer and soar through the skies with your genius aircraft. The levels are relaxing, beautiful and challenging. Some levels will test your piloting skills while others your engineering. Learn to optimize aerodynamics as you play and unlock new parts and perks as you progress",
